              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Cowpasture River Preservation Association, respondents argue that the trail is land administered by the Park Service, a view they say is inconsistent with the Act and would dramatically change the national trail system."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Atlantic Coast Pipeline",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98179207626d901fbf9bce66fe3a35e915c90a205dd4687238883d2528680073",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-98179207626d-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Atlantic Coast Pipeline, petitioners contend that a right\u2011of\u2011way granted over the trail does not affect subsurface rights."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondents",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98179207626d901fbf9bce66fe3a35e915c90a205dd4687238883d2528680073",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-98179207626d-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Respondents argue that a right\u2011of\u2011way \u201cunder\u201d the trail counts under the Appalachian Trail statute."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98179207626d901fbf9bce66fe3a35e915c90a205dd4687238883d2528680073",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-98179207626d-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 34,
              "start": 34
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, the Court is asked to interpret whether the statute\u2019s reference to lands \u201cadministered by the Park Service\u201d means administered in full, exclusively, or in any sense by the Park Service."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justices",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98179207626d901fbf9bce66fe3a35e915c90a205dd4687238883d2528680073",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-98179207626d-0000-0004"
